0 !BRICK_STATE {"schema_version":3,"status":"instruction_reconstruction_in_progress","version_label":"버전 0","reference_set":"LEGO Harry Potter Hogwarts Castle (71043)","source_manual_segments":["6590084-80.pdf","6590084-145.pdf","6607899-54.pdf","6607899-95.pdf","6607899-150.pdf","6607899-194.pdf","6607900-70.pdf","6607900-125.pdf","6607900-165.pdf","6607900-182.pdf","6607901-50.pdf","6607901-106.pdf"],"coverage":"6607901-50.pdf: booklet marker 22; printed p.10 steps 1-2, p.11 steps 3-5, read-ahead p.50-51 shows the frame supporting broad plate and wall/base structure. Circular side builds on separate pages 6-9 are excluded from this frame submodel.","piece_count":24,"placement_status":"Steps 1-7 represented; steps6-7 additional long beams, cross member, plate and wall support details are shape candidates with diagram-derived provisional positions. Step8 inner frame and later base connection remain pending.","validation":{"part_files":"shared LDraw shapes referenced","physical_fit":"not_tested","full_manual_coverage":"in_progress","geometry_checks":"instance IDs, transforms, quantities checked locally; full validator requires catalog offer metadata not verified"},"steps":[{"pages":"10-11","steps":[1,7],"evidence":"p.10 step1 callout: yellow 7-hole Technic beam and four friction pins; p.10 step2 adds gray Technic frame and long beam; p.11 steps3-5 extend gray support modules. p.50-51 broad plates/base walls rest over this framework. p.11 step3 callout shows two dark-gray 1x2 side-hole Technic bricks engaging the inner rectangular frame and long rail. p.11 step4 shows three repeated 3700 side-hole connector bricks; step5 callout shows one long gray beam, two tan 2x2 plates and one tan 2x3 plate. p.12 step6 adds gray long beam, triangular gray liftarm, gray triangular stud plate and white plate; step7 adds three gray blocks and one light-gray slope, one dark-green and two olive sloped pieces.","placement":"Beam datum centered; four pins at z=-60,-20,20,60 and y=10. Ste